usage
=====

there is no systemd journal, so jails must read log files. busybox
syslogd writes to /var/log/messages:

  ln -s /etc/sv/syslogd /var/service

put local settings in /etc/fail2ban/jail.local, e.g. for sshd:

  [sshd]
  enabled  = true
  backend  = auto
  logpath  = /var/log/messages

then enable the service:

  ln -s /etc/sv/fail2ban /var/service

check status with 'fail2ban-client status'.
